msgid "DShot ESCs"
msgstr "DShot ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:9 251e52c90b3a4d2a9970b8bc9623c304
#: 2e5adf8a5e7743c39c33e52115d1bf7b 32087d7b60d84234831db93f3bf81cb2
#: 4962ac509fa349ff811f61d87ac79d98 c10babe58a964219a3dcade8dadc6d73
#: e468a6e0a91b4f3abbeef29463d7d1b7 ed0fe05031af43d9b35632fc5d2ae8a0
msgid ""
"DShot is a digital ESC protocol which allows fast, high resolution digital "
"communication which may improve vehicle control which is especially useful "
"in multirotor and quadplane applications.  Other advantages include"
msgstr "DShot是一种数字ESC协议，允许快速、高分辨率的数字通信，可改善飞行器控制，在多旋翼和QuadPlane应用中尤为有用。其他优势包括"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:11 23fdae31b50b428ab164acba3d1738b8
#: 2b46b3e8b8fe4db38656062c5381daad 64816fab25bb4d8b818628255c7061fb
#: 7fdd9fae04eb4e20a801d2dfab048932 82c895096c50460aa77d05694d7f4259
#: 90aa613e576c465591ab232b9295e176 fd5beb489f2c409795ea6af92b2b59e1
msgid "Values sent to the ESC are checksum-protected"
msgstr "发送到ESC的数值受校验和保护"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:12 0947d008512e4e97be68554a2922d488
#: 1294cd45e7274956a4c09558d60bd154 40d2c553499c4a92925c3eab52714afa
#: 57ef49cbe734413f9f724c5535a405f5 9de8f6b4b138449eacbde9bf8c237c30
#: 9e18401a28a44b849c0f696f3b3d47d7 f2eacf9956c348ae887c869e41fa0c9b
msgid ""
"Clock differences between the ESC and autopilot don't affect flight "
"performance"
msgstr "ESC与飞控之间的时钟差异不影响飞行性能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:13 0bdeef74edbc461abcae95ff326499cb
#: 2d6b8b0f024c47e3971660354d566964 a1620fccf96846afa342bd764b22c30b
#: b795642547e74bbba55fed6df315b966 cfde8a0efc654d7fa60d7814310b499a
#: d6361ca1c23342e9b1570ab9181bb80e eb996115d2cf4db6822e095d43da6fee
msgid "ESC calibration is not required"
msgstr "无需ESC校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:15 379910f9271a48f3b888bcddbff46a65
#: 3bd6f1f0e8b7477daa4aed5b931109a3 4429a42a69474151be6929804e666139
#: 6263af0b136349008270e7296d372580 6c7fd44ecee1464eb18021779a5f7928
#: 8756cf933e084264beb9f3ee2176ea01 ac254e5b52134f5f9e237e5e2c5d1a9d
msgid ""
"DShot is the underlying ESC control protocol used by :ref:`BLHeli/AM32 "
"<common-blheli32-passthru>` ESCs.  Many BLHeli/AM32 ESC versions offer even "
"more features such as ESC configuration, :ref:`ESC telemetry <blheli32-esc-"
"telemetry>`, LED control and/or :ref:`Bi-directional dshot <bidir-dshot>`.  "
"If choosing a DShot enabled ESC we recommend using one that also supports "
"BLHeli32, AM32, or BLHeli_S."
msgstr ""
"DShot是 :ref:`BLHeli/AM32 <common-blheli32-passthru>` "
"ESC使用的底层ESC控制协议。许多BLHeli/AM32 ESC版本提供更多功能，如ESC配置、:ref:`ESC数传 <blheli32-esc-"
"telemetry>`、LED控制和/或 :ref:`双向DShot <bidir-"
"dshot>`。若选择支持DShot的ESC，我们建议使用同时支持BLHeli32、AM32或BLHeli_S的型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:18 12f87cd0fa614e07b9b3aaf670f1a4a0
#: 3356414731424df5b6576cd9ec2f650f 4023de7908214f7bb6e24cf4bbbec795
#: 82556f83b1084328a3805580c7f1416c a5349c8dd6e8418a8023f13fb625ede9
#: ca6c5d51cbda474e940996ce62a57efb e3a4d854158643fc8ab455f6c7d2bd67
msgid ""
"Only try DShot on ESCs that are known to support it or you will get "
"unpredictable results."
msgstr "仅在已知支持DShot的ESC上尝试，否则会得到不可预知的结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:21 0eb4b09da8b34889ad2d69cab27b5ca8
#: 19472b0cac1c4cc9b001950c0a84730a 20194658c7e14c01bc26aee299660330
#: 7db2c956ec7e426cbac73e44c75ae2e8 9824101adb7a4bb29ef8a34b95a9b95b
#: 9d97eac5d6b048be94a65fc2ed999e5e c5c9f33e79a1467980fc85219d1e6058
msgid ""
"Recently there is a growing number of proprietary and non-proprietary 16 / "
"32 bit ESCs with firmware that support DShot and other digital ESC "
"protocols, but not BLHeli32/AM32 specific features like passthrough and "
"telemetry. See your ESC's manual for further detail on supported features."
msgstr ""
"近年来，越来越多的专有和非专有16/32位ESC固件支持DShot和其他数字ESC协议，但不支持BLHeli32/AM32特定功能（如直通和数传）。详见您ESC的说明书了解支持的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:23 30f1a8d0d1574051b50306ab58d6db1b
#: 8a9781468c2c4ddeb2132d2bcd01ba37 aa7ed2c876a149f8b9997c96cdc48206
#: b10f98cfcde34b5b98f79793e6ec57fd d19be1ebebf049689683fd7f9418ba61
#: ec2b35833bc04499a54536913150cee5 f95d8e56afcd470fadca796e502d8a00
msgid ""
"most DShot ESCs normally will also operate as normal :ref:`PWM ESCs <common-"
"brushless-escs>`."
msgstr "大多数DShot ESC通常也可作为普通 :ref:`PWM ESC <common-brushless-escs>` 操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:28 169f291ca35645e488c04f69438410ec
#: 1e5037fa7fb44d27bdeb0bde2527af6e 475f8e6ae5e640e9a49766707e151487
#: 603bbaf08e014b7da6b67785c118ecc9 6ab56e7362bd4140a0e0769cd6c3f81f
#: ea473bb64f674ff28d12487b7adf5a93 ef604f7570bc45d59eb3233d5cc55dbc
msgid "Connecting the ESCs"
msgstr "连接ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:30 6b9848d5d3a8435cab0e0ae4b9585c05
#: 90796eb3c19c4e3593ef510f0a4fb7b5 a4c0c58490c44c44acb9dba89b86f263
msgid ""
"For firmware versions prior to 4.5, autopilots with an IOMCU co-processor "
"(e.g. Pixhawk, CubeOrange,etc.) the DShot ESCs should be connected to the "
"AUX outputs and not the MAIN outputs of the IOMCU co-processor. In firmware "
"versions 4.5 or later, the :ref:`BRD_IO_DSHOT<BRD_IO_DSHOT>` parameter may "
"be set to load Dshot compatible IOMCU firmware on the next bootup for some "
"autopilots using F103 IOMCUs. If this parameter is not present, then the "
"autopilot does not have DShot capability on its IOMCU outoputs. See the "
":ref:`IOMCU Dshot Limitations <iomcu-dshot>` section for limitations and "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"4.5版本之前的固件，对于带IOMCU协处理器的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange等），DShot "
"ESC应连接到AUX输出而非IOMCU协处理器的MAIN输出。4.5及更高版本固件中，对于某些使用F103 "
"IOMCU的飞控，:ref:`BRD_IO_DSHOT<BRD_IO_DSHOT>` "
"参数可设置为在下次启动时加载兼容DShot的IOMCU固件。若此参数不存在，则该飞控的IOMCU输出不支持DShot。详见 :ref:`IOMCU "
"Dshot限制 <iomcu-dshot>` 章节了解限制和更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:32 35b9b0c3529b492281afc8052d002216
#: 3c0645595dbc44e9a1ce767b2a88b8f7 51f480d64529416bb7a118eb1eab3cf6
#: 73a50962fbbd440c8280bbc3925d546d 8e7e0f1b40074b748fdd1a9c8f830238
#: c1aad124540f47d68a3cf16fac550679 e33deb7152d446f1a3031d60d65cefe5
msgid ""
"On CubeOrange DShot works on all channels.  AUX1 cannot be used for Bi-"
"Directional DShot meaning only AUX2 to AUX6 can be used for Bi_directional "
"DShot.  (`see issue "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/20362>`__)."
msgstr ""
"在CubeOrange上，DShot适用于所有通道。AUX1不能用于双向DShot，因此仅AUX2至AUX6可用于双向DShot。（`参见问题 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/20362>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:34 0452af04fd7a402da4de6cba9b6fcc78
#: 1438ae84a83d47f5b42c6f41e53023f4 549fd3a98864439f94eef5cab9b3283c
#: 83e98cea17c64110bba0f9f4c0df98f5 9ece73d9c7be4a76902371b9b1f48a23
#: a29ede99d4254eb8825ff2002aa1a2e9 e7771acf1c4a42b9bd88969037f2ef2f
msgid ""
"For :ref:`other boards <common-autopilots>` without a separate IOMCU "
"coprocessor, any servo/motor outputs can be used for DShot."
msgstr "对于 :ref:`其他没有独立IOMCU协处理器的控制板 <common-autopilots>`，任何舵机/电机输出均可用于DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:36 0ee6d41cdd8f4ccda95ee6d372d0e120
#: 34247ee0ae284f65a812230608da238e 4d92f38074d343d5819bb57a8e071db0
#: 75dcf8b40f13499783181635765da6f7 9a83365b86f44019bc1560d843500f7d
#: a16f0a0c8af04025a0f5eeac20090aa0 d13d36ed53e447949602751a9f3aaa00
msgid ""
"Please see the :ref:`Mixing ESC Protocols <dshot-mixing-escs>` section below"
" for more details on limitations"
msgstr "详见下方 :ref:`混合ESC协议 <dshot-mixing-escs>` 章节了解更多限制详情"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:39 0ee6f6cb38cf4a28867fbcb881682710
#: 2321106e37ab40bb8a98b58ca6bc5a99 4e6e9f6478554b2393aa60b5a6d3417b
#: 69ccbf32644c474cb2ebb1f301dc97f7 71c82dd82d3d4cd496ae2695390dfaa5
#: 9db660d7e4014b3d9ec757d68d2ffcad e7fe26420cec4c71a01674e83bae7ec3
