#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:44 2004ccd154394c3f8ca8bdc6e36bab33
#: 36303edb02204286bb3dc6fc7d941c2c 564dccaeb4ed4eb686e5fb8a34da47ab
#: 5dd0bc31229044669b835948540b2ec9 7831558ceedd4829b43d02826ff5a581
#: 82b8f61486f64ff5aee09e530357e422 cb213144f3f745519f81c29a8f38b4bf
msgid "Select the DShot baud rate"
msgstr "选择DShot波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:47 77d482b089dd4e62b887b39ae91844e1
#: 9151695db882405c8f84e0ea009c26b0 ac5329bf51344429b89ec971ae52cdbd
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` for the desired baud rate and reboot "
"the autopilot"
msgstr "设置 :ref:`MOT_PWM_TYPE <MOT_PWM_TYPE>` 为期望的波特率并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:49
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:51 4edf3a4f3f794f5faa8aa7ae9121ae5a
#: 5d987b539b094a028519bb4dc10bc830 766d14dbb6ad47e5afee517823498111
#: 8d7629bbd6e548f38431b2bbc5a2216e a2cdc0be73864dbd81ede1e51a2a169d
#: ba261663602543148ec0505d1bef7691 d95027fc7e3340aba0318637b3aab6f3
msgid ""
"DShot150 at 150kbaud (recommended for larger aircraft with long signal lead "
"runs)"
msgstr "DShot150，150kbaud（推荐用于信号线较长的大型飞行器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:50
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:52 060b6231a22842cdb1db5fd32b35d550
#: 0f8f911b99c647038df206d1c5034e72 4e856aa3d9f4491bb1a75e3146d87f29
#: 683c60e9b0424543ad7ed32c40662665 8021f3028ac14b779626ac528d75e94f
#: 9457ca0257b84a9c851d306f9470a540 a208f96d10c34a32b179092ab7ef86fd
msgid "DShot300 at 300kbaud"
msgstr "DShot300，300kbaud"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:51
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:53 11cf69204779413f9a36b9f5fd6fffa5
#: 131942ca4c6440458076e7253071c992 2bf06f8242574cd49625bc2dd3cb822a
#: 4fa9e58ed62d42ddac5ba9002038b3a6 a89f7eca3bbd48b48217e38af0bf890a
#: d204441b7f48481eb7973b5402d2559c f1cb1af0f2e54e25beb168a7dab45bcc
msgid "DShot600 at 600kbaud (recommended for most vehicles)"
msgstr "DShot600，600kbaud（推荐用于大多数飞行器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:52
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:54 0242fe6745b04820a67b160ecb01f58a
#: 1f75f839250c40f2966ec6351ae20b42 3e26f1ab9b014ace8a2d74d6d7d64d22
#: 6d1f1a6849804c0fbc628a2af5c044bf adef602e37ba4a8eb2100e80b8cae839
#: dc317339b1ac493b96afc34d76912234 e7acef96762e4987b7e928c2480a7724
msgid "DShot1200 at 1200kbaud"
msgstr "DShot1200，1200kbaud"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:54
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:56 274d5de55e724609b7f57eca6685ae90
#: 3351476e5a9d4fa69aba6c19ee75fd69 88a50b53334948b886930cb79289d001
#: 9b04ce7c8bbf4ea398787114dfdf2949 a1561762a0584c1dbee07fb5e0a3ea5d
#: b5b70c3e77d9487c81ec77b6678af430 ec5520e6475147148f59f3c77e08cf6d
msgid ""
"For larger aircraft with longer cable runs using DShot ESC protocol, we "
"recommend using the lowest baud rate, DShot150, as it is the most reliable "
"protocol (lower baudrates are less susceptible to noise on cables)."
msgstr ""
"对于使用DShot "
"ESC协议且线缆较长的大型飞行器，我们建议使用最低波特率DShot150，因为它是最可靠的协议（较低波特率对线缆上的噪声不那么敏感）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:56
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:58 0ca1f724c06c461db3c9b5ace845922d
#: 0f70892ce9ff44feb3465b343ef33d86 55d3b33c526e433bbf97c4fbeddba49e
#: 8ea7bdf04c554d0eb590373f43cdac51 bc1f66ea9b994b53862c6c561751df7f
#: e6786f5578744421a4dd838d743e6b9e efaad64738154455a7538f90c7cea689
msgid ""
"For smaller craft, DShot600 is by far the most widely used and can therefore"
" be a more suitable choice simply because of the amount of testing that it "
"has had, rather than the newer DShot1200 protocol."
msgstr ""
"对于小型飞行器，DShot600是迄今为止使用最广泛的，因此可能是更合适的选择——原因在于它经过了大量测试，而不是因为比更新的DShot1200协议更好。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:58
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:60 4392db4259f3402fbc75d65cee6a0aa8
#: 5203a64f67144ea0b5e651fb53f7c016 cac41e943c0547008d8a656221828a94
#: d29f76c4bbd644f581574fa9ba07b67e d5964c52f3cf44088b2c1cafbd0e57da
#: d6452882063f4799a358bf1e6eae2ecb dc8b5fc90ed14c67a8fb22d100add105
msgid ""
"Higher rates (e.g. DShot600 and DShot1200) are more susceptible to noise but"
" have the advantage that they tie up the allocated DMA channel for less time"
" which can be beneficial on autopilots with a lot of DMA sharing."
msgstr "较高速率（如DShot600和DShot1200）对噪声更敏感，但优点是占用DMA通道的时间更短，这在DMA共享较多的飞控上有优势。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:60
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:62 22114161bd2946b886a2be1df8d2b2a1
#: 75ad782bc3174fcab1edafe9e3057762 786c7ebc272248e8a1582df4b98063a2
#: 83a112321bc94329a619060c8b1a9ba3 9730b84eb64d4065b98621ecec5ca7c4
#: a6dfcd43a6814e2d81028a6862f5e209 c962f765091e49aba2bbdae27a4e22e1
msgid ""
"If :ref:`Bi-directional DShot <bidir-dshot>` will be used, DShot300 and "
"DShot600 are preferred, because this feature requires a longer pulse width "
"as it has to wait for the response from the ESC before it can send another "
"pulse.  Bi-directional DShot does not share DMA channels and so there is no "
"impact on other peripherals.  Bi-directional DShot is only supported on "
"BLHeli32/AM32 ESCs"
msgstr ""
"若将使用 :ref:`双向DShot <bidir-"
"dshot>`，首选DShot300和DShot600，因为该功能需要更长的脉冲宽度——它必须等待ESC的响应才能发送下一个脉冲。双向DShot不共享DMA通道，因此对其他外设没有影响。双向DShot仅在BLHeli32/AM32"
" ESC上受支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:63
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:65 3328fba97c0a4668a51b3b73c432fabe
#: 39dd7453944c459e90ffbcf9a61ced1b 84fdc8cce754497083d9da6ea74cca8e
#: 99831e1907614c2ab302d694d038f182 b355c692133a4bbf9583f158a15bb287
#: ccd619d4d0704f39888233580ee19e55 cf539ae0e9cd48c99a3569deacea3c70
msgid "Configure the Servo Functions"
msgstr "配置舵机功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:65
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:67 41ae6b6e90ae4eea85757aa268e9cd9b
#: 438b25ea4b7c442f91a101d14e75a364 5f1a364f695d4057bb1c834c83115b52
#: 796b069cc2f34b1b85e722110860501d b5af65e0d01545a59447c0a1d12fc5ce
#: bda74070d7364240b9482a0722607a17 e7ebb9c475b64d5e9de7e7ecc857a0e4
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, if using an autopilot with an IOMCU (e.g. Pixhawk, "
"CubeOrange,etc.) the ESCs should be connected to the AUX outputs instead of "
"the default MAIN outputs.  This in turn means that the corresponding "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` parameters must be updated so the "
"autopilot knows which output is connected to the ESCs/motors.   This can be "
"most easily done using Mission Planner's \"Servo Output\" page"
msgstr ""
"如上所述，若使用带IOMCU的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange等），ESC应连接到AUX输出而非默认的MAIN输出。这意味着必须相应更新 "
":ref:`SERVOx_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` "
"参数，使飞控知道哪个输出连接到ESC/电机。最简便的方法是使用Mission Planner的「Servo Output」页面"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:69
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:71 17214ce06e23412e89a3b397f182e0f7
