#: 4352e390ba674eb49fde127e011924ae 5a3095999c8e43bc9afcf70921b1e3f4
#: 5bec432e630f4767a2dba2f538e73734 96c3c04fc43f471eacccb0a1634885cd
#: d042c5135515449e9b0c34b5bd22a218
msgid ""
"Currently, only BLHeli32, AM32, and BLHeli_S capable reversible DShot ESCs "
"are supported. In order to use one, the output which drives it must be "
"designated with the appropriate bit in the "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>` bitmask parameter. This will map "
"the outputs 1000-1500-2000 values to the correct digital values for the ESC "
"to provide FullReverse-Idle-FullForward range operation, respectively."
msgstr ""
"目前，仅支持 BLHeli32、AM32 和 BLHeli_S 的可逆 DShot 电调。使用时，驱动该电调的输出须在 "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>` 位掩码参数中设置对应位。这将把输出的 1000-1500-2000 "
"数值映射为电调的正确数字值，以实现全反转-怠速-全正转的范围操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:121
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:123
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:125
#: 0468343587ba406d900c2d12a9d14de1 73b511f60c694997892bbbe3a4010f14
#: 90a5adab4cef4317a7a4ac737f234a7b d0e021c558304ac48886520ad1818371
