#: fb7b74e0cc8442d79bd32db483d9efd5
msgid ""
"If :ref:`DShot commands <dshot-commands>` have been enabled then ArduPilot "
"will automatically configure the ESCs to reversible mode (3D mode) at "
"startup, according to the :ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>`. "
"Enabling :ref:`DShot commands <dshot-commands>` will allow the other DShot "
"commands to be sent to any other ESC configured as DShot by the DShot mask "
"parameters discussed in :ref:`DShot setup instructions <common-dshot-escs>`."
msgstr ""
"若已启用 :ref:`DShot 指令 <dshot-commands>`，ArduPilot 将在启动时根据 "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_3DMASK<SERVO_BLH_3DMASK>` 自动将电调配置为可逆模式（3D 模式）。启用 :ref:`DShot"
" 指令 <dshot-commands>` 还允许将其他 DShot 指令发送给由 :ref:`DShot 设置说明 <common-dshot-"
"escs>` 中讨论的 DShot 掩码参数配置为 DShot 的任意其他电调。"

