#: ae34b6878c7c4902b641d92ddc25192d
msgid ""
"For :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` and :ref:`other boards "
"<common-autopilots>` without a separate IOMCU coprocessor, all servo/motor "
"outputs can be used."
msgstr ""
"对于 :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` 和其他没有独立 IOMCU 协处理器的 :ref:`飞控 "
"<common-autopilots>`，所有舵机/电机输出均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:143
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:145
#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:147
#: 083bda5a80844e429880a940772666e7 37671054a142418d8bcc6c209948800d
#: 4b03368708934d42bb2b4bd9efd41a6d 6b6fd2c4392a47f2a004bffdf5abf4de
#: 73d96a0efd9d460e893016afcc1a0899 80842e396d14422e9a3c40f33a57f88b
#: f59506a15c8a454498c6bfe60a556870
msgid ""
"Groups of outputs sharing a common timer, MUST have the same advanced "
"configuration. Usually, these are specified in the autopilot's hardware "
"description linked from the :ref:`common-autopilots` page. For example, if "
"an output is configured for DShot in a group, then you cannot use another "
"output in that group for Normal PWM ESC **or** normal PWM servo operation."
msgstr ""
"共享同一定时器的一组输出必须使用相同的高级配置。通常，这些信息会在 :ref:`common-autopilots` "
"页面链接的飞控硬件描述中说明。例如，若某组内的某个输出配置为 DShot，则该组内的其他输出不能用于普通 PWM 电调 **或** 普通 PWM "
"舵机操作。"

