#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:74 5c35da33fcea42e394ec21beb5ee2d34
#: d760015d95a64e2e88b0e1c2b720ae2e
msgid ""
"On Plane, all other motors use Normal (PWM) protocol. However, in Plane, any"
" motor, like the traditional fixed wing's main motor or Dual Motor "
"Tailsitters (SERVOx_FUNCTION = 70 throttle, 73 throttle left and / or 74 "
"throttle right), can be changed to a protocol other than PWM using the "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_MASK<SERVO_BLH_MASK>` parameter to specify the output number"
" of the motor together with the :ref:`SERVO_BLH_OTYPE<SERVO_BLH_OTYPE>` "
"parameter to select the protocol of these motors independently of that "
"selected for the copter function motors."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 上，所有其他电机使用普通（PWM）协议。然而，在 Plane "
"中，任何电机，如传统固定翼的主电机或双电机尾座飞机（SERVOx_FUNCTION = 70 油门、73 左油门和/或 74 右油门），都可以使用 "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_MASK<SERVO_BLH_MASK>` 参数指定电机输出编号，以及使用 "
":ref:`SERVO_BLH_OTYPE<SERVO_BLH_OTYPE>` 参数独立于多旋翼功能电机所选协议来选择这些电机的协议，从而更改为 PWM"
" 以外的协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:30 144ab860f4b4438ba513fe5b64297efb
#: 9fde048248614ea89656c7d6a6992079 c8883121dc654c0e9a78c8f990d62209
#: ff3e89e6faa94207a64734bef2eb3757
msgid ""
"For firmware versions prior to 4.5, autopilots with an IOMCU co-processor "
"(e.g. Pixhawk, CubeOrange,etc.) the DShot ESCs should be connected to the "
"AUX outputs and not the MAIN outputs of the IOMCU co-processor. In firmware "
"versions 4.5 or later, the :ref:`BRD_IO_DSHOT<BRD_IO_DSHOT>` parameter may "
"be set to load Dshot compatible IOMCU firmware on the next boot-up for some "
"autopilots using F103 IOMCUs. If this parameter is not present, then the "
"autopilot does not have DShot capability on its IOMCU outoputs. See the "
":ref:`IOMCU Dshot Limitations <iomcu-dshot>` section for limitations and "
"more information."
msgstr ""
"对于 4.5 之前的固件版本，带 IOMCU 协处理器的飞控（如 Pixhawk、CubeOrange 等）应将 DShot 电调连接到 AUX "
"输出，而不是 IOMCU 协处理器的 MAIN 输出。在 4.5 或更高固件版本中，对于部分使用 F103 IOMCU 的飞控，可设置 "
":ref:`BRD_IO_DSHOT<BRD_IO_DSHOT>` 参数，在下次启动时加载兼容 Dshot 的 IOMCU "
"固件。如果该参数不存在，则该飞控的 IOMCU 输出不具备 DShot 能力。有关限制及更多信息，见 :ref:`IOMCU Dshot "
"Limitations <iomcu-dshot>` 章节。"

